# Line endings: the pipeline records are LF; eol=lf overrides core.autocrlf at checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The coverage matrix is compared BYTE-FOR-BYTE against `CoverageMatrix::render()` by the
# coverage-completeness gate. `render()` is `writeln!`-built (LF) and written verbatim, so the
# checked-out file must keep LF on every host — the wildcard above is the repo-wide policy; this
# rule stays as the NAMED gate-correctness control for the one file whose bytes a gate compares,
# so the guarantee survives any later narrowing of the wildcard.
coverage-matrix.md text eol=lf
